<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_action_debug_postgresql">ActionDebugPostgresql</link></para>

<para>This class handles the debugging actions for PostgreSQL within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It retrieves and displays PostgreSQL command line output based on the provided arguments. </para>
